# The Distortion World from B4F (78, 77), where cp15's dw-b3f route ends, to Sendoff Spring: append to cp15 after
# that line. The connecting legs were found by tools/replays/dw-search.ts from the chained state (not the dw-*
# replays' constructed starts); the rest are the dw-* bodies with the asserts on constructed state dropped
# (platform/puzzle bits, hidden ghosts, camera, Cyrus's appearance), Surf's fixed A timings replaced by
# advance text, and Strength from party slot 1 (Bibarel). Passes on seeds 1-3 from cp14's anchor (twice, save
# round trip) with a party that can beat Cyrus (404) and Giratina: Empoleon L61 and Bibarel L19 lose to Cyrus.
# B4F west to its platform 0, up to B3F (79, 62), south and east to platform 2 at (95, 70), down to B4F (Cyrus walks off)
